---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="Household Tips — TestedByTom" description="Little things Tom has figured out around the house. Some obvious, some not.">
<style>
  main {
    max-width: 860px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 2.5rem 1.25rem 5rem;
  }
  .page-header {
    margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
    padding-bottom: 2rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
  }
  .page-tag {
    display: inline-block;
    background: var(--rust);
    color: white;
    font-size: 0.65rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.15em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    padding: 0.25rem 0.65rem;
    border-radius: 2px;
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }
  .page-title {
    font-family: 'Fraunces', serif;
    font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 5vw, 2.8rem);
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--brown);
    line-height: 1.15;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }
  .page-subtitle {
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    font-style: italic;
    font-family: 'Fraunces', serif;
  }
  .tips-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(320px, 1fr));
    gap: 1.5rem;
  }
  .tip-card {
    background: var(--warm-white);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 2px;
    padding: 1.75rem;
    text-decoration: none;
    display: block;
    transition: border-color 0.15s, box-shadow 0.15s;
  }
  .tip-card:hover {
    border-color: var(--tan);
    box-shadow: 0 2px 12px rgba(59,42,26,0.07);
  }
  .tip-card-tag {
    font-size: 0.65rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--rust);
    margin-bottom: 0.6rem;
    display: block;
  }
  .tip-card-title {
    font-family: 'Fraunces', serif;
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--brown);
    line-height: 1.3;
    margin-bottom: 0.6rem;
  }
  .tip-card-desc {
    font-size: 0.88rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    line-height: 1.6;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }
  .tip-card-meta {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
  }
  .tip-card-rating {
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--brown);
  }
  .tip-card-rating span { color: var(--rust); }
  .tip-card-link {
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    color: var(--rust);
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.03em;
  }
</style>

<main>
  <div class="page-header">
    <span class="page-tag">Household Tips</span>
    <h1 class="page-title">Household Tips</h1>
    <p class="page-subtitle">Little things I've figured out around the house. Some obvious in hindsight, some not.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="tips-grid">

    <a href="/household-tips/paper-towel-half-roll" class="tip-card">
      <span class="tip-card-tag">Kitchen</span>
      <div class="tip-card-title">Cut Your Paper Towel Roll in Half. You'll Never Go Back.</div>
      <p class="tip-card-desc">One cut with a sharp knife and your paper towels last twice as long. Small hint of danger included.</p>
      <div class="tip-card-meta">
        <span class="tip-card-rating"><span>★</span> 5.00 / 5</span>
        <span class="tip-card-link">Read tip →</span>
      </div>
    </a>

    <a href="/household-tips/shower-curtain-washing-machine" class="tip-card">
      <span class="tip-card-tag">Bathroom</span>
      <div class="tip-card-title">Wash Your Shower Curtain in the Washing Machine</div>
      <p class="tip-card-desc">No scrubbing, no chemicals, no effort. Throw it in and go do something else.</p>
      <div class="tip-card-meta">
        <span class="tip-card-rating"><span>★</span> 5.00 / 5</span>
        <span class="tip-card-link">Read tip →</span>
      </div>
    </a>

    <a href="/household-tips/cast-iron-seasoning" class="tip-card">
      <span class="tip-card-tag">Kitchen · Cast Iron</span>
      <div class="tip-card-title">How to Re-Season a Cast Iron Pan You Messed Up</div>
      <p class="tip-card-desc">A little rust dust isn't the end of the world. Salt, a wet paper towel, some oil, and you're back in business.</p>
      <div class="tip-card-meta">
        <span class="tip-card-rating"><span>★</span> 5.00 / 5</span>
        <span class="tip-card-link">Read tip →</span>
      </div>
    </a>

    <a href="/household-tips/cooking-oil-guide" class="tip-card">
      <span class="tip-card-tag">Kitchen · Reference</span>
      <div class="tip-card-title">Cooking Oil Reference Guide</div>
      <p class="tip-card-desc">Smoke points, flavor profiles, best uses, and what to avoid. Filterable by what you're actually cooking.</p>
      <div class="tip-card-meta">
        <span class="tip-card-link">View guide →</span>
      </div>
    </a>

    <a href="/household-tips/pallet-roller-stand" class="tip-card">
      <span class="tip-card-tag">Garage · Free Build</span>
      <div class="tip-card-title">Free Heavy-Duty Roller Stand from a Pallet & Old Casters</div>
      <p class="tip-card-desc">Need a cart to move something seriously heavy around the garage? You might already have everything you need.</p>
      <div class="tip-card-meta">
        <span class="tip-card-link">Read tip →</span>
      </div>
    </a>

  </div>
</main>
</Layout>
